<h1>Fit Multiple Lines</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This command is accessible from <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>System &gt; Performance Check Utilities &gt; Measure Multiple Lines</b></span>.</p>
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Fit Multiple Lines</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command fits a line through each stripe in the visible selected scan data and calculates statistics. This command is grayed if there is no selection or all selections are hidden.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP173761900" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table cellspacing="0" class="whs4">
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs5">
<td class="whs6">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/image025.jpg" width="546px" height="355px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB">Selection to fit Multiple lines</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
</div>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">A line is fitted through each stripe, no entity is created in the document.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">After the lines are fitted the following dialog will appear:</span></p>
<p><img src="../images/fit_multiple_lines.gif" width="257px" height="165px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></p>
<ul class="whs9">
<li style="text-align:justify;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Mean RMS</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">-</span> <span lang="EN-GB">mean value of Root Mean Square distance from each line to the selected points from the corresponding stripe.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="text-align:justify;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Median RMS</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">-</span> <span lang="EN-GB">median value of Root Mean Square distance from each line to the selected points from the corresponding stripe.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="text-align:justify;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Standard deviation</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">-</span> <span lang="EN-GB">standard deviation of Root Mean Square distances from each line to the selected points from the corresponding stripe.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
